OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright start, before clouding
OL,6,Fover through Wednesday morning. Chance
OL,7,Fof some patchy rain for a time. Cloud
OL,8,Fthen breaking in the afternoon with
OL,9,Fmore in the way of sunshine returning
OL,10,Fand winds easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIncreasingly clear night for
OL,13,Fmuch of the region. Given light winds,
OL,14,Ftemperatures will fall, with a chilly
OL,15,Fend to the night, especially in rural
OL,16,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
